WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.069 --> 00:00:05.570
Now Cleo wanted to trust her new friends.

2
00:00:05.571 --> 00:00:09.845
And she didn't want to admit Roscoe was right.

3
00:00:09.846 --> 00:00:13.241
But it sure seemed like he was.

4
00:00:13.242 --> 00:00:18.171
"Well?" she said. "Where's the trunk?"

5
00:00:18.172 --> 00:00:20.103
Sasha suddenly shouted.

6
00:00:20.104 --> 00:00:24.887
"Violet, you ninny! You left the trunk on the hilltop!"

7
00:00:24.888 --> 00:00:27.467
"Oops!" Violet said.

8
00:00:27.468 --> 00:00:31.718
"We'd better go back and look for it. Bye!"

9
00:00:31.719 --> 00:00:34.569
Roscoe held up a paw.

10
00:00:34.570 --> 00:00:38.917
"Hold on a minute. What's in that trunk anyway?"

11
00:00:38.918 --> 00:00:42.839
"Hmm." Sasha tapped her chin.

12
00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:45.844
"Just some clothes."

13
00:00:45.845 --> 00:00:48.661
Cleo folded her arms.

14
00:00:48.662 --> 00:00:52.391
"Why did you bring a bunch of clothes up here?"

15
00:00:52.392 --> 00:00:55.947
Sasha and Violet looked at each other.

16
00:00:55.948 --> 00:01:02.447
"I think the trunk was full of stolen jewels," Cleo said. "I

17
00:01:02.448 --> 00:01:07.304
also think you stole Zeke's shovel to bury the jewels." Violet

18
00:01:07.305 --> 00:01:13.104
gasped. "That's not true!" "You'd

19
00:01:13.105 --> 00:01:16.757
better come with us," Roscoe said. "Run,

20
00:01:16.758 --> 00:01:19.752
Violet!" Sasha yelled. The

21
00:01:19.753 --> 00:01:22.518
thieves took off in different directions. Roscoe

22
00:01:22.519 --> 00:01:24.819
ran after Sasha. Cleo

23
00:01:24.820 --> 00:01:28.800
dropped the shovel to chase Violet. Violet

24
00:01:28.801 --> 00:01:36.097
ran into a field of cactuses. She

25
00:01:36.098 --> 00:01:38.282
jumped over a short one. Cleo

26
00:01:38.283 --> 00:01:42.135
leaped over it easily. Then

27
00:01:42.136 --> 00:01:44.863
Violet jumped over a taller one. It

28
00:01:44.864 --> 00:01:47.169
snagged the hem of her dress. "Yikes!"

29
00:01:47.170 --> 00:01:54.425
Violet slammed into the ground. Cleo

30
00:01:54.426 --> 00:01:56.995
helped her up. Then

31
00:01:56.996 --> 00:02:03.080
she put handcuffs on the thief. ***

32
00:02:03.081 --> 00:02:05.807
Roscoe chased Sasha.

33
00:02:05.808 --> 00:02:08.334
A rock rolled under his foot.

34
00:02:08.335 --> 00:02:11.912
He tripped and fell.

35
00:02:11.913 --> 00:02:15.796
Sasha looked over her shoulder. "Ha-ha!"

36
00:02:15.797 --> 00:02:21.396
As Roscoe got back up, he saw Sasha stop suddenly.

37
00:02:21.397 --> 00:02:22.957
He ran to her.

38
00:02:22.958 --> 00:02:26.984
There was a rattlesnake curled up in front of her.

39
00:02:26.985 --> 00:02:30.373
Its head was raised, ready to strike!

40
00:02:30.374 --> 00:02:34.666
Roscoe grabbed Sasha and yanked her out of the way.

41
00:02:34.667 --> 00:02:39.332
"Whew!" Sasha smiled. "Thank you so—"

42
00:02:39.333 --> 00:02:48.049
Click! Roscoe slapped handcuffs on her.

43
00:02:48.050 --> 00:02:50.996
*** Violet and Sasha sat in the jail

44
00:02:50.997 --> 00:02:56.412
cell. Clank! Cleo slammed the door

45
00:02:56.413 --> 00:03:00.399
shut. "Federal marshals will arrive in the morning," said Roscoe.

46
00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:03.299
"They'll take you back to Plattsville."

47
00:03:03.300 --> 00:03:06.146
Sasha leaned back on her cot.

48
00:03:06.147 --> 00:03:09.652
"You can't prove we took those jewels."

49
00:03:09.653 --> 00:03:14.832
"Yeah," Violet said. "We're innocent."

50
00:03:14.833 --> 00:03:18.967
"That's for a jury to decide," Roscoe said.

51
00:03:18.968 --> 00:03:25.724
Sasha shrugged. "There's no proof. They'll set us free."

52
00:03:25.725 --> 00:03:31.025
Cleo and Roscoe went to the other side of the room.

53
00:03:31.026 --> 00:03:35.750
"Is that true?" Cleo whispered. "Will they be set free?"

54
00:03:35.751 --> 00:03:40.042
Roscoe frowned. "It's possible."

55
00:03:40.043 --> 00:03:43.578
This made Cleo mighty angry.

56
00:03:43.579 --> 00:03:46.183
It's bad enough the cats tricked her.

57
00:03:46.184 --> 00:03:49.792
Next they were going to trick a jury.

58
00:03:49.793 --> 00:03:55.922
"Roscoe, we can't let them get away with this!"

